  GET  /farmers/:id                     - Get farmer data
  GET  /farmers/:id/animals             - Get animals
  GET  /farmers/:id/appointments        - Get appointments

✅ FIXES APPLIED:
  ✓ Better intent detection with context awareness
  ✓ Bare reply handling (1-2 word answers)
  ✓ Confirmation signal classification (no keyword misfires)
  ✓ Parameter extraction with pending questions
  ✓ Session continuation after submit
  ✓ Location extraction fixed (no "is the" bug)

